{"step_index":106,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-09-23T00:38:53Z","thinking":"The focus is on understanding `Set_TouchPadMode`. Initially, the plan is to test the function with arguments 0, 1, and 2 to observe their effects. Need to identify the specific argument values passed when the touchpad is enabled via Button 1. The `TouchpadModule` and `OnTouchpadChanged` events are the next areas to investigate.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"CodeContent":"\"$asm = [System.Reflection.Assembly]::LoadFrom('C:\\\\Program Files (x86)\\\\LG Software\\\\LG Control Center\\\\LG Control Center.exe')\\n$t = $asm.GetType('LG_Control_Center.LGCCMainWnd')\\n$m = $t.GetMethod('OnTouchpadChanged', [Reflection.BindingFlags]'NonPublic,Instance,Public')\\n$bytes = $m.GetMethodBody().GetILAsByteArray()\\n$mod = $m.Module\\n\\nWrite-Host \\\"OnTouchpadChanged IL:\\\"\\nfor ($i = 0; $i -lt $bytes.Length; $i++) {\\n    $offset = $i\\n    $b = $bytes[$i]\\n    Write-Host -NoNewline ('{0:X4}: {1:X2} ' -f $offset, $b)\\n    if ($b -in @(0x72, 0x28, 0x6F, 0x7E, 0x7B, 0x7D, 0x20)) {\\n        $val = [BitConverter]::ToInt32($bytes, $i+1)\\n        Write-Host -NoNewline ('[0x{0:X8}] ' -f $val)\\n        try {\\n            $mem = $mod.ResolveMember($val)\\n            Write-Host -NoNewline ('({0}.{1}) ' -f $mem.DeclaringType.Name, $mem.Name)\\n        } catch {\\n            try {\\n                $str = $mod.ResolveString($val)\\n                Write-Host -NoNewline ('(\\\"{0}\\\") ' -f $str)\\n            } catch {}\\n        }\\n        $i += 4\\n    }\\n    Write-Host \\\"\\\"\\n}\\n\"","Description":"\"Disassemble OnTouchpadChanged\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\lg\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\211c437a-15bb-44af-a76a-d6654c8fc8c3\\\\scratch\\\\disasm_ontouch.ps1\"","toolAction":"\"Writing disasm script for OnTouchpadChanged\"","toolSummary":"\"Disasm OnTouchpadChanged\""}}]}
